{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7JmeVHmt5og5XQATLQw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm sorry about your mother. A few questions before I draft. Each answer would change what the letter says:\n\n1. **Who is it going to?** What's the practice called, and do you know the name of the dentist or hiring manager? Also, what name should I sign it with?\n2. **Why this practice?** Do you have a connection to it, such as being a patient, knowing someone there, or having heard good things? Even a small local detail makes the opening stronger than a generic one.\n3. **Did staff report to you at the vet clinic?** If so, about how many people did you hire, train or schedule? The posting stresses supervising 9 people, so this matters most.\n4. **How do you want to explain the seven years?** I'd suggest one plain sentence, something like \"I spent the past seven years as my mother's caregiver, which included managing her insurance claims and care across six specialists.\" Does that feel right, or would you rather say less?\n5. **Have you done anything about Dentrix yet?** For example, a tutorial, a trial, or a plan to take a course. If not, I'll point to the AVImark changeover as proof you learn new systems quickly. If you have started, I'll say so.\n\nIf you don't know some of these, just say so and I'll write without them."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":677,"cache_read_input_tokens":9530,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":677},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9b99e550-44d0-4143-b172-7dc5fa6b03a1","uuid":"9e6901e2-2bd9-4812-9333-529047a0de5e","timestamp":"2026-11-16T21:21:03.106Z","request_id":