{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7JnScBo21YVK1a7ABsN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<final_document>\nDear Dr. Pierce,\n\nI am writing to apply for the Office Manager position at Brookside Family Dental. For eleven years I was office manager at a veterinary clinic with four veterinarians and 14 staff. I handled scheduling and billing and kept a busy practice running smoothly for both the doctors and the clients.\n\nTwo results from that job stand out. In 2014 I led the clinic's move from paper records to practice management software. In my last three years there, I brought unpaid invoices more than 90 days old down from about $38,000 to $9,000. I take pride in both because they took steady follow-through and clear communication with staff and clients.\n\nI spent the past seven years as my mother's caregiver, which included managing her insurance claims and her appointments with six specialists. That time showed me billing and scheduling from the patient's side, and how much a well-run office matters to the people it serves.\n\nI know your practice uses Dentrix. My experience is with AVImark, so I have enrolled in the Dentrix online course, about 20 hours of training, and I will finish it before my first day. Having taken one practice from paper to software, I am confident I can learn a new system quickly.\n\nI would welcome the chance to talk with you about how I can support your team and your patients. Thank you for your time and consideration.\n\nSincerely,\n\nLinda Marsh\n</final_document>\n\nThe letter is about 250 words. A few notes:\n\n- **Contact details:** Add your phone number and email above or below your name.\n- **Supervising staff:** The posting stresses supervising 9 people, but I didn't say you supervised anyone because you weren't sure of the number. If you did train, schedule or oversee staff, even informally, add a sentence like \"I trained and scheduled our front-desk team.\" It's the biggest thing that could make this letter stronger.\n- **Age:** Your age isn't mentioned anywhere, and it shouldn't be."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":677,"cache_read_input_tokens":10207,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":677},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9b99e550-44d0-4143-b172-7dc5fa6b03a1","uuid":"288e7ed8-213a-4f04-bddd-58d551357b1e","timestamp":"2026-11-16T21:21:21.875Z","request_id":"req_011Ch7JnSUVpfHjdLhnx1DaR"}
